@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
hide footbox
actor "Pengguna berizin" as P0
participant "Finance / Billing" as P1
participant "localStorage" as P2
participant "Pembuat dokumen" as P3
P0 -> P1: Pilih invoice / konfigurasi
P1 -> P2: Baca data tersimpan
P2 --> P1: Record lokal
P0 -> P1: Tandai lunas / simpan paket
P1 -> P2: Simpan perubahan lokal
P2 --> P1: Berhasil atau gagal
P1 --> P0: Konfirmasi setelah simpan
P0 -> P1: Unduh invoice / draf
P1 -> P3: Bangun dari record tersimpan
P3 --> P0: Berkas PDF atau EML
@enduml